{
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.0": "Fire! Get it off me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.1": "Keep that flame away from me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.2": "Burning... I'm burning! Back!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.0": "Call off that beast!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.1": "Get that animal away from me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.2": "Not the teeth! Not the teeth!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.0": "That's my blood... that's all my blood!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.1": "I'm bleeding out! Someone!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.2": "Too much red. I'm done here!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "To me! Cut them down!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "On your feet, all of you! Kill it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "Everyone, now! Bury them!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. I am %2$s, of %3$s. Remember it. I will remember you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "So you're the one. %2$s, of %3$s. Say my name when you run, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Look at me, %1$s. %2$s, of %3$s. The last face you'll see.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.0": "You. Again. %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.1": "%1$s. I haven't forgotten.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.2": "Back for more, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.0": "Running again, %1$s? All I saw last time was your back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.1": "%1$s! The one who ran! No running now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.2": "You ran from me once, %1$s. Your legs won't save you twice.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.0": "You had me down, %1$s. You should have finished it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.1": "%1$s. I've healed. Have you?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.2": "I've been thinking about you, %1$s. Every night.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.0": "%1$s let me live. I owe you nothing.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.1": "You let me live, %1$s. I still can't tell if that was kindness or foolishness.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.2": "Mercy, %1$s? You'll wish you hadn't.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.0": "I killed you once, %1$s. This time I'll do it properly.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.1": "%1$s! I wear your face! Come and take it back!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.2": "Back from the dead, %1$s? I'll send you again.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.0": "%1$s. You held a knife to me and asked your questions. Here's my answer.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.1": "You made me talk, %1$s. Now I'll make you scream.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.2": "I told you things, %1$s. I'll take them back with your tongue.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.0": "Not yet!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.1": "Is that all?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.2": "I'm still standing!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s is done! Who's next?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "I'll wear %s's head tonight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "That's how %s dies. Remember it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "Who leads now? %s does!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Kneel, all of you! %s leads now!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I'm %s now. Say it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "Another head for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "Higher! %s climbs higher!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "Who stops %s now? No one!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s! %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "Hail %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! Blood for %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.0": "You thought me dead, %1$s? So did I.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.1": "%1$s! I crawled out of the dirt for you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.2": "Death let me go, %1$s. It wanted you instead.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.0": "I was cold, %1$s. Something warmed me. Not kindly.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.1": "Kill me, %1$s. Go on. I've seen the other side. I'm not afraid.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.2": "They dug me up for you, %1$s. I won't waste it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.0": "%1$s. They laugh at me because of you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.1": "You shamed me before my own, %1$s. Your blood will wash it off.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.2": "My name is a joke now, %1$s. Yours will be a grave.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.0": "You killed one of ours, %1$s. I've come for the debt.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.1": "%1$s. Someone has to pay for him. You.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.2": "I swore on his body, %1$s. I keep my oaths.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.0": "You killed my brother, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.1": "My brother's blood is on you, %1$s. I'll have it back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.2": "We swore to die together, %1$s. You made a liar of me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.0": "Get off %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.1": "No one touches %s but me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.2": "%s! I'm coming!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.0": "You... let me up? %1$s, you fool.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.1": "Why, %1$s? Why not finish it?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.2": "I won't forget this, %1$s. Either way.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.0": "Don't look at me! Nobody look at me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.1": "%1$s... I'll kill you for this!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.2": "Get away from me! All of you!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.0": "%1$s. I knelt to you once. That's over.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.1": "I served you, %1$s. Death let me go. I'm my own man now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.2": "Your oath died with me, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.0": "You thought I'd kneel forever, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.1": "%1$s. I wore your leash. Now you'll eat my blade.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.2": "I was only ever waiting, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.0": "The coward comes! %1$s, I waited all day!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.1": "%1$s! Your challenge rotted on the gate. So will you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.2": "You nailed your name up and never came, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.0": "Bend? I've been dead, %1$s. There's nothing left to bend.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.1": "Your light is nothing to me, %1$s. Kill me again. Try.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.2": "I have no master, %1$s. Not since the grave.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.0": "You're too weak to own me, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.1": "Kneel to you, %1$s? I've beaten better.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.2": "Not to you. Never to you, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.0": "That fire in you, %1$s... I'll follow it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.1": "You beat me fair, %1$s. My blade is yours.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.2": "Lead, %1$s. I'll be at your back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.0": "What... what did you put in my head, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.1": "I hear an old voice giving orders. Yours now, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.2": "My thoughts aren't mine, %1$s. They're yours.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.no": "No. Not now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.nothing": "There's no one of my old lot left to strike, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.0": "%2$s? I know the back way in. Give me until dawn, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.1": "I'll burn %2$s's stores and bring you the rest, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.2": "%2$s will bleed before sunrise, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.0": "They'll take me back, %1$s. Fools. I'll listen.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.1": "Two days, %1$s. I'll come back knowing what they fear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.2": "I'll be one of them again, %1$s. For a while.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.0": "Back, %1$s. And not empty-handed.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.1": "Did you miss me, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.2": "Done, %1$s. As you asked.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.0": "I'm done kneeling.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.1": "You thought I was yours? I was waiting.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.2": "This is where it ends.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.0": "%1$s! You nailed it to my gate! Come! Just you and me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.1": "Back, all of you! %1$s is mine!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.2": "Nobody interferes. %1$s and I settle this.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.0": "My captains stand. While %1$s of them live, you can't touch me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.1": "Ha! Kill my captains first. All %1$s of them!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.2": "%1$s of mine stand between us. Go through them.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.0": "Captain? There's no captain here, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.1": "Ask someone else, %1$s. I know nothing.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.2": "I don't know any captains, %1$s. I swear it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.0": "All right, %1$s, all right! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.1": "You didn't hear it from me, %1$s. %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.2": "Fine! Fine, %1$s! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.thick_hide.told": "Blades barely bite %s, they say.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.arrow_proof.told": "Arrows glance off %s. Don't waste yours.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fire_born.told": "%s walks through fire like it's bathwater.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.heavy_handed.told": "When %s hits you, bones snap. Ask anyone who limps.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.hard_to_kill.told": "%s has been left for dead before. He always gets back up.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.blood_rage.told": "Hurt %s and he gets worse. Faster. Angrier.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.venomous.told": "%s poisons his blades. The cuts go green.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.rallying.told": "When %s starts bellowing, we all come running.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.deathless.told": "%s died once. Whatever brought him back took the fear out of him.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.soft_to_arrows.told": "%s hates archers. An arrow went straight through him once.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.glass_jaw.told": "%s has a soft head. One good club and he sees stars.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.blind_side.told": "%s only watches whoever he's fighting. Hit him from the side.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.burns_easily.told": "%s goes up like dry straw.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_fire.told": "%s won't go near fire. He screams at a torch.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_beasts.told": "%s runs from wolves, bears, anyone on a horse.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_blood.told": "Make %s bleed and he panics. He can't stand the sight of it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.book.jaymoskingdoms.captain_orders.page": "To the camp, from its chief.\n\n%1$s holds the road this moon. Keep out of his way.\n\n%2$s\n\nBurn this.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "Nailed to a stake at the edge of %2$s's ground, in %1$s's hand: \"%3$s, I'm coming for you.\"",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "A rag on a spear outside the camps of %2$s, daubed in blood: %1$s means to kill %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from %2$s: %1$s has sworn on his blade to see %3$s dead.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. I am %2$s, of %3$s. The crows know my name. Now you do.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "%2$s of %3$s. I've split better than you, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Stand, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s takes your head standing.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s fed the crows!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "%s's skull goes on my pole!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "The fire takes %s tonight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "To me! Blood on the snow!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Axes up! Break them!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "Howl, brothers! Kill!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s! %1$s! Skulls for %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "Raise your axes for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! The crows feast!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "Another skull for %s's pole!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "The fire burns higher for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "%s climbs on their bones!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "The warband follows %s now!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Kneel by the fire! %s leads!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I'm %s now. Chant it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "Bones tied to a stake at the edge of %2$s's ground, a name cut in the wood: %1$s will have %3$s's skull.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "A painted shield hung over the road near %2$s: %1$s has sworn to burn %3$s on his fire.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.barbarian.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from the fires of %2$s: %1$s drinks every night to the death of %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. You stand before %2$s, of %3$s. Mark it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "So this is the one. %2$s, of %3$s. You'll be a fine prize, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Bow, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s does not ask twice.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s is broken! Take the spoils!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "%s will make a fine banner!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "Drag %s back to the tents!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "Raise the banner! To me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Crossbows! Bring them down!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "For the host! Strike!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "Hail %1$s! Hail!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "%s! Lord of the raid!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "Banners for %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "Another prize for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "The host bows to %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "Higher, and higher! %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "The host answers to %s now!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Kneel to the banner! %s leads!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I am %s now. Say it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "A torn banner staked by the road near %2$s, a crossbow bolt through a name: %1$s hunts %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "An effigy burned at the edge of %2$s's ground: %1$s has sworn to drag %3$s back in chains.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.illager.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from %2$s: %1$s has put a price on %3$s's head and means to collect it himself.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. Name's %2$s, of %3$s. Mind it, or I'll carve it in you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "Well, look at this. %2$s of %3$s. You'll fetch a fine price, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Stand still, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s likes a clean cut.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s goes over the side!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "Feed %s to the fish!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "Strip %s and split the purse!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "All hands! To me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Boarders away! Cut 'em down!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "No quarter, you dogs!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s! %1$s! Three cheers!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "Drinks on %s tonight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! Terror of the sea!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "Another share for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "%s's name goes up the mast!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "Who'll stop %s now? Nobody!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "New captain! %s, lads!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Knuckle your brows to %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I'm %s now. Say it loud!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "Nailed to the door of a dockside tavern near %2$s's coves: \"%3$s, %1$s is coming for your hide.\"",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "A black rag tied to a buoy off %2$s's shore, a name stitched in red: %1$s has marked %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.pirate.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from the coves of %2$s: %1$s has sworn on his share to see %3$s hanged.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s... I am %2$s, of %3$s. I remember warmth. I'll remember you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "%2$s of %3$s. The grave sent me, %1$s. For you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Come closer, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s has been waiting a long time.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s is cold now. Like me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "Rise, %s. Rise and serve.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "Another for the dark. %s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "Up from the dirt! To me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Rise! All of you, rise!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "Take them down into the ground!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s... %1$s...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "The dark loves %s...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! The grave remembers!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "The grave gives %s more.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "%s grows colder. Stronger.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "Another soul for %s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "The dead answer %s now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Kneel in the dirt. %s leads.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I am %s now. The dark agrees.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "A grave dug open by the road near %2$s, a name scratched on its stone: %1$s waits there for %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "Bones laid out in the shape of a name at the edge of %2$s: %1$s has marked %3$s for the dark.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.raised.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from %2$s: the dead whisper that %1$s walks for %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. I am %2$s, of %3$s. My horns remember.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "Small one. %2$s of %3$s will grind you to ash, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Face me, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s never turns.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s is ground into the ash!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "%s's gold is mine!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "Trampled! %s, trampled!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "To me, herd! Charge!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Lower your horns! Crush them!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "Stamp them into the ash!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s! %1$s! Horns for %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "Gold for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! Breaker of the ash!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "More gold for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "The herd bows to %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "%s's horns grow longer!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "The herd follows %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Bow your horns! %s leads!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "I am %s now. Bellow it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "A horn driven into the ash by a Nether road, a name burned on it: %1$s of %2$s hunts %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "Gold hammered into a ring of thorns at the edge of %2$s's wastes: %1$s wants %3$s's blood.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.hornkin.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from the wastes of %2$s: %1$s has bellowed %3$s's name at every fire.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.kindhearted": "%1$s. I'm %2$s, of %3$s. I don't want to do this. Walk away.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.cheerful": "Ha! A visitor! %2$s, of %3$s. Let's make this fun, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.devout": "My patron sent you, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s will make a fine offering of you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.dutiful": "%2$s of %3$s. I have my orders, %1$s. Nothing personal.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.brave": "%2$s, of %3$s. I fear nothing, %1$s. Least of all you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.proud": "Kneel, %1$s. You stand before %2$s of %3$s. No one better.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.greedy": "%2$s, of %3$s. What's in your purse, %1$s? Hand it over and maybe you live.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.suspicious": "Who sent you, %1$s? %2$s of %3$s isn't that easy to fool.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.timid": "S-stay back, %1$s! I'm %2$s, of %3$s! The others are close!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.hotheaded": "%2$s of %3$s! Enough talk, %1$s! Fight me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.spiteful": "%2$s, of %3$s. I'll take everything you love first, %1$s. Then you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.gloomy": "%2$s, of %3$s. One of us dies today, %1$s. Probably both.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.kindhearted": "%s... it didn't have to end like that.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.cheerful": "Ha! %s! That was a good one!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.devout": "Take %s, my patron! An offering!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.dutiful": "%s is dealt with. As ordered.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.brave": "Who else? %s wasn't enough!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.proud": "Did you see that? %s never stood a chance against me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.greedy": "Turn out %s's pockets. Mine. All mine.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.suspicious": "%s is down. Make sure. Stab it again.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.timid": "I-is %s dead? Really dead?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.hotheaded": "MORE! %s wasn't enough! MORE!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.spiteful": "And %s's friends are next.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.gloomy": "%s is gone. We all go, in the end.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.kindhearted": "%1$s. Me %2$s, of %3$s. Me no wanna smash you. Go away.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.cheerful": "Ha! Visitor! %2$s, of %3$s! We have fun, %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.devout": "Da big one sent you, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s gonna give you to him.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.dutiful": "%2$s of %3$s. Boss say smash, %1$s. So me smash.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.brave": "%2$s of %3$s. Me scared of nothin, %1$s. Specially not you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.proud": "Kneel, %1$s! Dis %2$s of %3$s! Da best!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.greedy": "%2$s of %3$s. What you got, %1$s? Give it, maybe you live.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.suspicious": "Who send you, %1$s? %2$s of %3$s not stupid.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.timid": "S-stay back, %1$s! Me %2$s of %3$s! Udders comin!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.hotheaded": "%2$s of %3$s! No talk, %1$s! FIGHT!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.spiteful": "%2$s of %3$s. Me smash yer friends first, %1$s. Den you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.gloomy": "%2$s of %3$s. Somebody die today, %1$s. Maybe both.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.kindhearted": "%s... me sorry. Bit.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.cheerful": "HA! %s! Dat wuz fun!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.devout": "Dis one for you, big one! %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.dutiful": "%s smashed. Like boss said.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.brave": "Who next? %s too easy!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.proud": "You see dat? %s no chance against ME!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.greedy": "%s's stuff mine now. All mine.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.suspicious": "%s down. Hit it again. Make sure.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.timid": "%s... dead? Really dead?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.hotheaded": "MORE! %s not enough! MORE!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.spiteful": "%s's friends next.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.gloomy": "%s gone. Everybody go, end.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.kindhearted": "%1$s! Me %2$s, of %3$s. Me no want stabby. Shoo, shoo.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.cheerful": "Hee! Visitor! %2$s of %3$s! Fun times, %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.devout": "Da shiny one want you, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s bring you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.dutiful": "%2$s of %3$s. Orders is orders, %1$s. Sorry. Not sorry.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.brave": "%2$s of %3$s not scared, %1$s! Not even little bit!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.proud": "Bow, %1$s! %2$s of %3$s, cleverest of all!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.greedy": "%2$s of %3$s. Ooh, shiny purse, %1$s. Give, give!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.suspicious": "Who send you, %1$s? %2$s of %3$s see trick!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.timid": "B-back, %1$s! %2$s of %3$s got friends! Lots!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.hotheaded": "%2$s of %3$s! Stop talkin, %1$s! STAB!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.spiteful": "%2$s of %3$s. Me poison yer friends, %1$s. Den you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.gloomy": "%2$s of %3$s. Everybody die, %1$s. Today, you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.kindhearted": "Oh. %s. Didn't mean it. Mostly.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.cheerful": "Hee hee! %s! Again, again!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.devout": "For da shiny one! %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.dutiful": "%s done. Like boss said.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.brave": "%s easy! Who next?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.proud": "See? %s no match for clever me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.greedy": "%s's pockets! Mine! Mine!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.suspicious": "Poke %s again. Playin dead maybe.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.timid": "Is %s... gone? Really?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.hotheaded": "MORE! Where more?!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.spiteful": "Now %s's friends.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.gloomy": "%s gone. We all go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.0": "Wait, wait, %1$s! I'll give you something better than me! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.1": "Let me go and I'll tell you a secret, %1$s. %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.0": "You'll pay for this, %1$s. I swear it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.1": "I won't forget your face, %1$s. Ever.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.0": "Help! Over here! All of you!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.common.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.1": "Someone! Anyone! Get it off me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.0": "Wait, %1$s! Me give you better! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.1": "Let me go, me tell secret, %1$s. %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.0": "You pay for dis, %1$s. Me swear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.1": "Me never forget yer face, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.0": "Help! Over here! Everybody!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.1": "Somebody! Get it off me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.0": "Wait, wait, %1$s! Me sell you better one! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.greedy.sells.1": "Let go, me tell, %1$s! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.0": "You pay, %1$s. You pay big.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.spiteful.swears.1": "Me remember yer face, %1$s. Always.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.0": "Help! Help! Over here!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.goblin.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.timid.calls.1": "Friends! Come! Quick!",
